## 1. `GET /:uuid/proof` — `packages/backend/src/api/crypto/reports.ts:153`

The read path starts here. After loading the `reportLocks` row from the DB (lines 160–164), it immediately attempts an on-demand upgrade:

```ts
// line 175
const upgraded = await upgradeReportLock(lock);
const final = upgraded ?? lock;
const otsProofHex = final.otsStatus === "upgraded" ? final.otsProofComplete : final.otsProofPending;
```

The comment at line 170–174 explains the intent: `pollAnyCalendar` races all calendars in parallel under a 5 s wall-clock budget, bounding `/proof` latency.

