## 4. `pollAnyCalendar` — `packages/backend/src/lib/ots-poll.ts:91`

The preferred calendar (the one embedded in the pending attestation) is prepended to `OTS_CALENDARS` if not already present (lines 97–99). A shared `AbortController` enforces the 5 s wall-clock budget:

```ts
const budgetCtrl = new AbortController();
const budgetTimer = setTimeout(() => budgetCtrl.abort(), budgetMs);  // 5000 ms default
```

All calendars race via `Promise.any` (line 115):

```ts
const racers = calendars.map((cal) =>
    pollOtsCalendar(cal, hashHex, budgetCtrl.signal).then(bytes => {
        if (!bytes) throw new Error(`${cal}: still pending`);
        return { bytes, calendar: cal };
    }),
);
const winner = await Promise.any(racers);
```

