## 5. `pollOtsCalendar` — `packages/backend/src/lib/ots-poll.ts:47`

The actual HTTP call to each calendar:

```ts
const res = await fetch(`${calendarBaseUrl}/timestamp/${hashHex}`, {
    method: "GET",
    headers: { Accept: "application/vnd.opentimestamps.v1" },
    signal,
});
// 200 → return bytes; 404 → return null (still pending); else throw
```

A per-request 10 s timeout wraps this independently of the 5 s budget (`REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS = 10_000`, line 30).

